# Quebec: Lumber Mill (52 hammers) in production with 20 banked, no tools in stock, treasury 716.
# Buy price = hammer deficit x 13 (+ tools deficit x (tools price 6 + 4)); BUY only tops the stock up,
# the project completes at the next turn change (not exercised: tests stay inside one turn).
click 168 128              # open Quebec (map tile 45,24)
wait 10
key 3                      # Construction tab (DOS DS:0x337 starts at 0 = Production)
wait 3
click 217 141              # BUY: "Cost to complete Lumber Mill: 416, Treasury: 716", rows Never mind / Complete it
wait 8
click 100 139              # Never mind: nothing changes, treasury still 716
wait 8
click 217 141              # BUY again
wait 8
click 100 150              # Complete it: treasury 716-416 = 300, hammers 20 -> 52, hammers_purchased += 32
wait 8
click 282 141              # CHANGE
wait 5
click 150 103              # Printing Press (52 hammers, 20 tools): hammers carry over, only tools are short
wait 5
key b                      # keyboard BUY: "Cost to complete Printing Press: 200, Treasury: 300"
wait 8
click 100 150              # Complete it: treasury 300-200 = 100, tools stock 0 -> 20
wait 8
click 282 141              # CHANGE
wait 5
click 150 151              # Church (64 hammers): 12 short = 156 gold, more than the 100 treasury
wait 5
click 217 141              # BUY: refused, info popup "Cost to complete Church: 156, Treasury: 100", no choice
wait 8
key Return                 # dismiss the popup: nothing bought, project is Church
wait 8
key Escape                 # leave the colony, back on the map
wait 5
